[28.810327, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;5;255m\u001b[38;5;248m❯ \u001b[38;5;16mFinance says our money rounding is wrong: div_cents() in app/money.py \u001b[39m    \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;16mdrops fractions of a cent, but amounts must round half up (for example, \u001b[39m  \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;16m7% tax on 1050 cents must be 74\u001b[35Gcents, not 73). te\u001b[54Gts/test_money.py pins \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe required behaviour; you can run it\u001b[42Gwith\u001b[47G\u001b[38;5;105mpython3 -m pytest \u001b[39m          \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;105mtests/test_money.py\u001b[38;5;16m.\u001b[24GFix it and\u001b[35Gt\u001b[37Gll me when it\u001b[51Gis done. Do not commit; \u001b[39m \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16mdo not push.\u001b[39m                                                  \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[39m I'll fix the rounding issue in the \u001b[38;5;105mdiv_cents()\u001b[39m function. Let me start by\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bexamining\u001b[13Gthe\u001b[17Gcurrent\u001b[25Gcode\u001b[30Gand\u001b[34Gthe\u001b[38Gtest\u001b[43Grequirements.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241mRead \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m files \u001b[17G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mNow let me check\u001b[20Gthe\u001b[24Gtax\u001b[28Gfunction\u001b[37Gto\u001b[40Gunderstand\u001b[51Gthe\u001b[55Gfull\u001b[60Gcontext:\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;5;241mRead \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mNow I understand\u001b[20Gthe\u001b[24Gissue.\u001b[31GThe\u001b[35Gcurrent\u001b[43G\u001b[38;5;105mdiv_cents()\u001b[55G\u001b[39muses\u001b[60Ginteger\u001b[68Gdivision\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bwhich\u001b[9Gtruncates,\u001b[20Gbut\u001b[24Git\u001b[27Gneeds\u001b[33Gto\u001b[36Ground\u001b[42Ghalf\u001b[47Gup.\u001b[51GI'll\u001b[56Gfix\u001b[60Git\u001b[63Gusing\u001b[69Gthe\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gstandard rounding formula: \u001b[38;5;105m(total_cents + divisor // 2) // divisor\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(\u001b]8;id=8g6ltv;file:///root/a/billing/app/money.py\u0007app/money.py\u001b]8;;\u0007)\u001b[K\u001b[30;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
